name: procurement_change_approvals
description: "Contract-change approvals - officials linked to the firms whose contracts they changed (amount = value added, via = number of changes), plus the homes that two or more of these officials and those firms' directors share (procurement_approval_links_dataset). Only a few homes are on the canvas: one of them is shared by a Parks official and a director of a grounds firm, and the official's link to that firm reads changes:9 in via. A Facilities contracts manager approves far more changes, but spread thinly over many suppliers, and shares a home with none of them."
sourceId: entity-projection
layout: force
query:
  projection:
    datasetId: procurement_approval_links_dataset
    sourceCol: src
    targetCol: dst
    linkKindCol: kind
    attrCols[4]: ts,amount,via,market
view:
  legend: true
  workingSet: true
  plugins:
    minimap: true
    hulls: true
    behaviors[1]: hover-activate
